      "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/Swizzle-AI/arb-target-proofline/pull/14?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\" alt=\"Explain Change \u2192\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- recent_review_status_start -->\n\nNo actionable comments were generated in the recent review.\n\n<!-- recent_review_status_end -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Walkthrough</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- coderabbit_walkthrough_overview_removed -->\n\n**Changes: Report scheduling**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Scheduled timestamp validation** <br> `reports.py`|schedule raises ValueError when scheduled_at is negative. Non-negative values continue through the existing delivery insertion path.|\n\n**Possibly related PRs**\n\n- [Swizzle-AI/arb-target-coderabbit#13](https://github.com/Swizzle-AI/arb-target-coderabbit/pull/13): Validates that scheduled report timestamps are non-negative before inserting a delivery row.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"9d28f5951883b4b51894af1b19a23ecb9b5e8381\" -->\n<!-- change_assessment_priority:{\"version\":1,\"urgency\":\"p3\",\"manual\":false} -->\n**Change:** Feature\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong